$airkit_attention $mol_list
	entries /$airkit_attention_entry
	calm_text @ \Nothing needs you
	rows <= items /
	Empty <= Calm $mol_view
		sub /
			<= calm_text
	Item* $mol_link
		arg <= item_arg* *
		minimal_height 56
		sub /
			<= Count* $mol_view
				attr *
					airkit_attention_tone <= item_tone* \neutral
				sub /
					<= item_count* \
			<= Text* $mol_view
				sub /
					<= What* $mol_view
						sub /
							<= item_what* \
					<= Why* $mol_view
						sub /
							<= item_why* \
			<= Go* $mol_view
				sub /
					<= item_action* \
